**findMany**
```sql
SELECT DISTINCT "distinctAlias"."person_userId", "distinctAlias"."sale_createdDate", "distinctAlias"."sale_id"
  FROM (
    SELECT DISTINCT ON ("person"."userId") "person"."userId" AS "person_userId", 
